title: The x402 yield catalog agents actually query: 14 feeds, 0 decisions
description: Inside agentic.market's keyless x402 catalog there are 14 DeFi yield feeds and not one go/no-go entry verdict. Grey Ridge's /defi/yield-entry-verdict ($0.01, keyless on Base) is the decision layer — SUSTAINABLE|DECAYING|OUTLIER|AVOID with a risk score and cited reasons.
